  tag: 0
  question: "Hoa v\u0103n tr\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED3ng cho th\u1EA5y c\u01B0 d\xE2n
    L\u1EA1c Vi\u1EC7t th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u1EDF ki\u1EC3u nh\xE0 n\xE0o?"
  options:
  - "Nh\xE0 s\xE0n"
  - "Nh\xE0 nhi\u1EC1u t\u1EA7ng b\u1EB1ng k\xEDnh"
  - "L\u1EC1u tuy\u1EBFt"
  - "L\xE2u \u0111\xE0i \u0111\xE1"
  correctIndex: 0
  explanation: "Tr\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED3ng c\xF3 h\xECnh nh\xE0 s\xE0n m\xE1i cong,
    ki\u1EC3u nh\xE0 ph\u1ED5 bi\u1EBFn c\u1EE7a c\u01B0 d\xE2n L\u1EA1c Vi\u1EC7t."
